'''Roppaku Kinsei''' (六白金星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|12=draft|12=draft}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|12=draft|12=draft}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|12=draft|12=draft}}. In the Post-Heaven Lo Shu Square, it occupies the northwestern position.
While it belongs to the same Metal element as {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|12=draft|12=draft}}, Roppaku Kinsei represents raw ore that has just been extracted from a mine.
