'''Roppaku Kinsei''' (六白金星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|qq=draft}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|qq=draft}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|qq=draft}}. In the Post-Heaven Lo Shu Square, it occupies the northwestern position.
While it belongs to the same Metal element as {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=draft}}, Roppaku Kinsei represents raw ore that has just been extracted from a mine.
== Attributes == * {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=draft}} - Metal * {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|qq=draft}} - Qian (乾) * {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干|qq=draft}} - Geng (庚), Xin (辛) * {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|qq=draft}} - Xu (戌), Hai (亥) * Season - Late Autumn * Direction - {{ill|Northwest|ja|西北|qq=draft}} * Month - October, November * Time - 19:00–23:00 * Number - Four, Nine * Color - White * Taste - Spicy
== Symbolic Meanings == * Movement, busyness, decisions, cities, gathering places, authority figures, elegance, emperors, {{ill|lungs|ja|肺|qq=draft}}, {{ill|immune system|ja|免疫|qq=draft}}, fathers, defense, heaven, completeness, dignity, power, competition * Circles, conflicts, regulations, faith, solidity, pregnancy, arrogance, fulfillment, the sun, luxury goods, vehicles, busyness, memorial services, charity, battle, health, donations, caregiving * Related to the body: ribs, pleura, blood pressure regulation, sweating, fever, tumors, heart, left lung, bone fractures, dizziness, tonsils, skin diseases
== Relationships with Other Stars == * Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|qq=draft}} (Metal generates Water), {{ill|Nikoku Dosei|ja|二黒土星|1=Second Black Earth Star|qq=draft}} (Earth generates Metal), {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|qq=draft}} (Earth generates Metal), {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=draft}} (Earth generates Metal) * Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Sanpeki Mokusei|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star|qq=draft}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=draft}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|qq=draft}} (Fire overcomes Metal) * Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Roppaku Kinsei, {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=draft}}
== Years in Which Roppaku Kinsei Occupies the Center == Years in which the remainder when divided by 9 is 5 are Roppaku Kinsei years.
‥‥ - [[1940]] - [[1949]] - [[1958]] - [[1967]] - [[1976]] - [[1985]] - [[1994]] - [[2003]] - [[2012]] - [[2021]] - [[2030]] - [[2039]] - [[2048]] - [[2057]] - [[2066]] - ‥‥
