'''Roppaku Kinsei''' (六白金星) is one of the {{ill|Nine Stars|ja|九星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nine Stars|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nine Stars|qq=}} used in {{ill|calendars|ja|暦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/calendars|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/calendars|qq=}} and {{ill|fortune-telling|ja|占い|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/fortune-telling|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/fortune-telling|qq=}}. In the Post-Heaven Lo Shu Square, it occupies the northwestern position.

While it belongs to the same Metal element as {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=}}, Roppaku Kinsei represents raw ore that has just been extracted from a mine.

== Attributes ==
* {{ill|Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|lt=Wuxing|ja|五行思想|1=Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|2=ja|3=五行思想|lt=Five Elements (Wuxing)|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|13=User:Immanuelle/Wuxing (Chinese philosophy)|qq=}} - Metal
* {{ill|Bagua|ja|八卦|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Bagua|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Bagua|qq=}} - Qian (乾)
* {{ill|Heavenly Stems|lt=Ten Heavenly Stems|ja|十干|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Heavenly Stems|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Heavenly Stems|qq=}} - Geng (庚), Xin (辛)
* {{ill|Earthly Branches|lt=Twelve Earthly Branches|ja|十二支|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Earthly Branches|qq=}} - Xu (戌), Hai (亥)
* Season - Late Autumn
* Direction - {{ill|Northwest|ja|西北|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Northwest|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Northwest|qq=}}
* Month - October, November
* Time - 19:00–23:00
* Number - Four, Nine
* Color - White
* Taste - Spicy

== Symbolic Meanings ==
* Movement, busyness, decisions, cities, gathering places, authority figures, elegance, emperors, {{ill|lungs|ja|肺|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/lungs|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/lungs|qq=}}, {{ill|immune system|ja|免疫|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/immune system|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/immune system|qq=}}, fathers, defense, heaven, completeness, dignity, power, competition
* Circles, conflicts, regulations, faith, solidity, pregnancy, arrogance, fulfillment, the sun, luxury goods, vehicles, busyness, memorial services, charity, battle, health, donations, caregiving
* Related to the body: ribs, pleura, blood pressure regulation, sweating, fever, tumors, heart, left lung, bone fractures, dizziness, tonsils, skin diseases

== Relationships with Other Stars ==
* Generating Cycle (相生) - {{ill|Ippaku Suisei|ja|一白水星|1=First White Water Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ippaku Suisei|13=User:Immanuelle/First White Water Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Ippaku Suisei|13=User:Immanuelle/First White Water Star|qq=}} (Metal generates Water), {{ill|Nikoku Dosei|ja|二黒土星|1=Second Black Earth Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nikoku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Second Black Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Nikoku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Second Black Earth Star|qq=}} (Earth generates Metal), {{ill|Goō Dosei|1=Fifth Yellow Earth Star|ja|五黄土星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Goō Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fifth Yellow Earth Star|qq=}} (Earth generates Metal), {{ill|Happaku Dosei|1=Eighth White Earth Star|ja|八白土星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Happaku Dosei|13=User:Immanuelle/Eighth White Earth Star|qq=}} (Earth generates Metal)
* Overcoming Cycle (相克) - {{ill|Sanpeki Mokusei|ja|三碧木星|1=Third Blue Wood Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sanpeki Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Third Blue Wood Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Sanpeki Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Third Blue Wood Star|qq=}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Shiroku Mokusei|ja|四緑木星|1=Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shiroku Mokusei|13=User:Immanuelle/Fourth Green Wood Star|qq=}} (Metal overcomes Wood), {{ill|Kyūshi Kasei|1=Ninth Purple Fire Star|ja|九紫火星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyūshi Kasei|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Kyūshi Kasei|13=User:Immanuelle/Ninth Purple Fire Star|qq=}} (Fire overcomes Metal)
* Harmonious Relationship (比和) - Roppaku Kinsei, {{ill|Shichiseki Kinsei|1=Seventh Red Metal Star|ja|七赤金星|qq=draft|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=|12=simple|13=User:Immanuelle/Shichiseki Kinsei|13=User:Immanuelle/Seventh Red Metal Star|qq=}}

== Years in Which Roppaku Kinsei Occupies the Center ==
Years in which the remainder when divided by 9 is 5 are Roppaku Kinsei years.

‥‥ - [[1940]] - [[1949]] - [[1958]] - [[1967]] - [[1976]] - [[1985]] - [[1994]] - [[2003]] - [[2012]] - [[2021]] - [[2030]] - [[2039]] - [[2048]] - [[2057]] - [[2066]] - ‥‥

